      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Chicago, Rock Island and Pacific Railroad once ran passenger trains through Haysville, a line locals still call the 'Rock Island'.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
